    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "My bad, I'll just paste the details here since the upload failed. \n\nHere is the client's spec: \"Modular Wireless Power Module (MWPM) - Uses a dynamic power distribution bus that shifts load between adjacent charging coils based on real-time impedance feedback to optimize efficiency in multi-device environments.\"\n\nAnd here is the most relevant snippet from the existing database (Patent US-2018-0456-A1): \"An inductive charging system comprising a plurality of modular coils and a dynamic distribution bus that adjusts power allocation to individual modules based on detected impedance levels to minimize energy loss.\"\n\nAnalyze these and give me that novelty summary for the filing. We really need this one to go through.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
