      "content": "That sounds like a solid angle. I'm just worried though—if the patent examiner looks closely at US-2018-0456-A1, they might argue that \"adjusting power allocation based on detected impedance levels\" is essentially the same thing as our \"real-time impedance feedback loop.\" \n\nWhat do you think? Is there any risk they'll just lump these together and reject our novelty claim based on that 2018 patent?",
